      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Isn\u0027t it still necessary to properly set new_instance for the guest, to keep the different instance.img entries in sync\n\nNot sure what is implied by being in sync. In case of VM is using instance.img based rbp:\n\n1) pvmfw is incapable of knowing `new_instance` from instance_hash.\n2) In case a malicious Android reruns a VM instance with a different instance_id, the Sealing CDIs change \u0026 Microdorid will not be able to decrypt its partition.\n\nStoring instance-hash in instance.img has no benefit",
      "parentUuid": "db9e449a_43c29880",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 7,
